Challenge Faced :
One challenge I faced was getting the page layout to look right when nesting semantic tags, since incorrect nesting 
sometimes broke the structure and styling. I also found it tricky at first to decide whether certain content belonged 
inside main or aside, as the difference between primary and secondary content wasn't always clear.
